  title: HUB
  body: 'Press F2-F9 to visit the test stations: F2 Targeting, F3 Sweep, F4 Hostiles,
    F5 Carry + Waypoints, F6 Breakables, F7 Pickups, F8 Failures, F9 Combat. F1 returns
    here. H hides the controls. F12 resets everything. In a station, stand on a green
    pad to read what to test.'
  radius: 5
