  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::ArenaHintZone
  title: S8-F  CART FIRST
  body: 'Walk to the cart. Press Z until the cart has an outline, then TAP left-click
    twice: two troops cluster around it (they do not damage it). Then press E to
    wake the hunter.

    EXPECT: the hunter ignores your closer troops and walks
    to the CART and attacks it. The Console shows ''target -> S8F_Cart''. When the
    cart breaks, it turns on your troops. Press X to clear your target afterwards.
    With 3 troops the cart is carried instead.'
  radius: 3
